[News] 近鉄は原因を調べて、早く復旧したいと話しています。

54
00:06:23,300 --> 00:06:26,036
[Host] Quiz time. Three questions.

55
00:06:26,636 --> 00:06:33,187
[Slow] 沖縄の梅雨明けは、平年と比べてどうでしたか。

56
00:06:33,987 --> 00:06:41,355
[Host] How was Okinawa's end of the rainy season compared to an average year? Answer: It was eight days later than usual.

57
00:06:41,956 --> 00:06:49,468
[Slow] 日本代表は、次の試合でどの国と対戦しますか。

58
00:06:50,267 --> 00:06:56,244
[Host] Which country will the Japan national team play against in their next match? Answer: Brazil.

59
00:06:56,843 --> 00:07:03,204
[Slow] 京都駅の脱線事故で、けが人はいましたか。

60
00:07:04,004 --> 00:07:10,531
[Host] Were there any injured people in the derailment at Kyoto Station? Answer: No, there were no injuries.

61
